          "source_text": "A <TEXTITOPEN_0001>subcategory<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> of a category <MATH_0001> is a category <MATH_0002>\nwhose objects and arrows form subsets of the objects and arrows of <MATH_0003>\nand such that source, target and composition in <MATH_0004> agree with those\nof <MATH_0005> and such that the identity morphism of an object of\n<MATH_0006> matches the one in <MATH_0007>. We say <MATH_0008> is a\n<TEXTITOPEN_0002>full subcategory<TEXTITCLOSE_0002> of <MATH_0009> if <MATH_0010> for all <MATH_0011>.\nWe say <MATH_0012> is a <TEXTITOPEN_0003>strictly full<TEXTITCLOSE_0003> subcategory of <MATH_0013>\nif it is a full subcategory and given <MATH_0014> any\nobject of <MATH_0015> which is isomorphic to <MATH_0016> is also in <MATH_0017>.\n",
